  "_readme": "EMC clinical/translational completeness sweep, 2026-08-07. The dev sandbox egress proxy 403s clinicaltrials.gov, ncbi.nlm.nih.gov, www.ebi.ac.uk, api.crossref.org, api.openalex.org and api.semanticscholar.org on CONNECT, so every registry/API read for this sweep is routed through the GitHub-hosted runner per CLAUDE.md 6. Targets are API endpoints returning JSON, not article pages: lit_fetch_urls.py's strip_html() is a no-op on JSON (no tags), so the payload survives whitespace-collapsed and readable. Purpose: enumerate (a) open trials an EMC patient could enter, (b) the full reported systemic-therapy evidence base including single case reports, (c) EMC models and public datasets.",

